mission "The Stormhaven Refuge"
    name "The Stormhaven Refuge"
    description "Deliver Ysabel's message to Harbourmaster Fen at Stormhaven."
    source "Mermaid's Rest"
    destination "Stormhaven"
    reward 720
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "The Edge of the Chart: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Stormhaven has become a refuge for crews driven from their homes by Company patrols.`
            `The harbour is full of damaged fishing boats and families living under sailcloth. The harbourmaster needs spare rigging, medicine, and a message from Ysabel.`
            `No battle is required. Bring the news that the free captains are coming and that the Company can be challenged.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `No battle is required. Bring the news that the free captains are coming and that the Company can be challenged.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Ysabel gives you a list of safe coves and asks you to tell the refugees that the free captains have not forgotten them.`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Stormhaven Refuge. Deliver Ysabel's message to Harbourmaster Fen at Stormhaven."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Fen says the Company has seized the old signal fort at Redoubt and is using it to direct patrols across the Outer Antilles.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The fort can be retaken if the patrol ships around it are driven off.`
        log "Completed The Stormhaven Refuge. Received 720 gold. The fort can be retaken if the patrol ships around it are driven off."
